{"seq":3,"slug":"browser-performance-timeline","title":"浏览器性能时间线 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/foundations/browser-performance-timeline","wordCount":785,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"浏览器性能时间线-api\">浏览器性能时间线 API</h1><p>每当你在 DevTools 的 Performance 面板中录制一段操作，底层驱动整个瀑布图的数据源就是 Performance Timeline API。它是浏览器暴露给 JavaScript 的标准化计时接口，也是所有 RUM 工具（web-vitals、Sentry SDK、Datadog Browser SDK）的采集基石。不理解这层 API，就无法真正理解性能数据从何而来、如何被加工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Performance Timeline 是 W3C 定义的一族标准，由多个规范共同组成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Performance Timeline API] --&gt; B[Navigation Timing]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Resource Timing]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Paint Timing]&#10;    A --&gt; E[User Timing]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Long Tasks API]&#10;    A --&gt; G[Long Animation Frames]&#10;    A --&gt; H[Event Timing]&#10;    A --&gt; I[Element Timing]&#10;    B --&gt; J[页面导航各阶段耗时]&#10;    C --&gt; K[每个资源的加载详情]&#10;    D --&gt; L[FP / FCP 时间点]&#10;    H --&gt; M[INP 测量基础]&#10;    G --&gt; N[脚本级归因]\">graph TD\n    A[Performance Timeline API] --&gt; B[Navigation Timing]\n    A --&gt; C[Resource Timing]\n    A --&gt; D[Paint Timing]\n    A --&gt; E[User Timing]\n    A --&gt; F[Long Tasks API]\n    A --&gt; G[Long Animation Frames]\n    A --&gt; H[Event Timing]\n    A --&gt; I[Element Timing]\n    B --&gt; J[页面导航各阶段耗时]\n    C --&gt; K[每个资源的加载详情]\n    D --&gt; L[FP / FCP 时间点]\n    H --&gt; M[INP 测量基础]\n    G --&gt; N[脚本级归因]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Entry Type</th>\n<th>规范</th>\n<th>提供的信息</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>navigation</code></td>\n<td>Navigation Timing L2</td>\n<td>DNS/TCP/TLS/TTFB/DOM 完整时间线</td>\n<td>页面加载性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resource</code></td>\n<td>Resource Timing L2</td>\n<td>每个资源的 initiator/大小/时间</td>\n<td>资源加载瀑布图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>paint</code></td>\n<td>Paint Timing</td>\n<td>FP、FCP 时间戳</td>\n<td>首次渲染监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>largest-contentful-paint</code></td>\n<td>LCP API</td>\n<td>LCP 元素及渲染时间</td>\n<td>Core Web Vital 采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>layout-shift</code></td>\n<td>Layout Instability</td>\n<td>偏移分数、来源元素</td>\n<td>CLS 计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>event</code></td>\n<td>Event Timing</td>\n<td>交互的三阶段延迟</td>\n<td>INP 计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>long-animation-frame</code></td>\n<td>LoAF API</td>\n<td>长帧内的脚本归因</td>\n<td>INP 根因定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mark</code> / <code>measure</code></td>\n<td>User Timing</td>\n<td>自定义标记和测量</td>\n<td>业务自定义指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"navigation-timing-详解\">Navigation Timing 详解</h2><p>Navigation Timing Level 2 记录了从页面开始导航到完全加载的每一个关键时间节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const [entry] = performance.getEntriesByType(&#39;navigation&#39;) as PerformanceNavigationTiming[];&#10;&#10;// 关键时间节点&#10;const dns = entry.domainLookupEnd - entry.domainLookupStart;&#10;const tcp = entry.connectEnd - entry.connectStart;&#10;const tls = entry.secureConnectionStart &gt; 0 ? entry.connectEnd - entry.secureConnectionStart : 0;&#10;const ttfb = entry.responseStart - entry.requestStart;&#10;const download = entry.responseEnd - entry.responseStart;&#10;const domParse = entry.domInteractive - entry.responseEnd;&#10;const domReady = entry.domContentLoadedEventEnd - entry.domContentLoadedEventStart;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntriesByType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'navigation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceNavigationTiming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 关键时间节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.domainLookupEnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.domainLookupStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tcp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.connectEnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.connectStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.secureConnectionStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.connectEnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.secureConnectionStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ttfb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.responseStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.requestStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> download</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.responseEnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.responseStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> domParse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.domInteractive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.responseEnd;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> domReady</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.domContentLoadedEventEnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.domContentLoadedEventStart;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些数据点直接对应网络瀑布图中的各段——当 TTFB 过高时优先检查服务端或 CDN；当 DOM Parse 过长时检查 HTML 体积和 render-blocking 资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"event-timing-与-inp-测量\">Event Timing 与 INP 测量</h2><p>Event Timing API 是 INP 的底层数据来源。每次交互产生的 <code>event</code> 条目包含三个关键时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// PerformanceEventTiming 接口核心字段&#10;interface PerformanceEventTiming extends PerformanceEntry {&#10;  processingStart: DOMHighResTimeStamp; // 事件处理开始时间&#10;  processingEnd: DOMHighResTimeStamp; // 事件处理结束时间&#10;  interactionId: number; // 交互分组 ID&#10;  // startTime = 事件产生时间&#10;  // duration = 从 startTime 到下一帧渲染完成&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 三阶段拆解&#10;// Input Delay = processingStart - startTime&#10;// Processing Time = processingEnd - processingStart&#10;// Presentation Delay = startTime + duration - processingEnd\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PerformanceEventTiming 接口核心字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceEventTiming</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  processingStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DOMHighResTimeStamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 事件处理开始时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  processingEnd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DOMHighResTimeStamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 事件处理结束时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  interactionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 交互分组 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // startTime = 事件产生时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // duration = 从 startTime 到下一帧渲染完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 三阶段拆解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Input Delay = processingStart - startTime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Processing Time = processingEnd - processingStart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Presentation Delay = startTime + duration - processingEnd</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>interactionId</code> 将同一次交互的多个事件（如 pointerdown → pointerup → click）归为一组，INP 取每组中 <code>duration</code> 最长的那个事件作为该交互的延迟值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"long-animation-frames-loaf-api\">Long Animation Frames（LoAF）API</h2><p>2025 年 Chrome 引入的 Long Animation Frames API 是 Long Tasks API 的升级替代品。Long Task 只告诉你&quot;有一个 &gt; 50ms 的长任务&quot;，但不告诉你是哪个脚本、哪个函数导致的。LoAF 提供了脚本级归因：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    // entry.scripts 包含该长帧内执行的脚本列表&#10;    for (const script of entry.scripts) {&#10;      console.log(`Source: ${script.sourceURL}`);&#10;      console.log(`Function: ${script.sourceFunctionName}`);&#10;      console.log(`Char position: ${script.sourceCharPosition}`);&#10;      console.log(`Duration: ${script.duration}ms`);&#10;      console.log(`Invoker: ${script.invoker}`);&#10;      // invoker 示例: &quot;IMG#hero.onload&quot;、&quot;BUTTON#submit.onclick&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;long-animation-frame&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // entry.scripts 包含该长帧内执行的脚本列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.scripts) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Source: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sourceURL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Function: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sourceFunctionName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Char position: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sourceCharPosition</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Duration: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Invoker: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">invoker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // invoker 示例: \"IMG#hero.onload\"、\"BUTTON#submit.onclick\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'long-animation-frame'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LoAF 的 <code>scripts</code> 数组精确到调用函数名和源码位置，配合 source map 可以直接定位到具体代码行——这让 INP 归因从&quot;某个 Long Task&quot;精确到&quot;第三方分析脚本的 trackEvent 函数执行了 180ms&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-timing-自定义标记\">User Timing 自定义标记</h2><p><code>performance.mark()</code> 和 <code>performance.measure()</code> 让你在代码的任意位置打桩，定义业务含义的时间段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 标记关键业务节点&#10;performance.mark(&#39;checkout-start&#39;);&#10;&#10;await processPayment();&#10;await updateInventory();&#10;&#10;performance.mark(&#39;checkout-end&#39;);&#10;performance.measure(&#39;checkout-flow&#39;, &#39;checkout-start&#39;, &#39;checkout-end&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 通过 PerformanceObserver 采集&#10;const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    // entry.name = &#39;checkout-flow&#39;&#10;    // entry.duration = 耗时（ms）&#10;    sendToRUM({ metric: entry.name, value: entry.duration });&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;measure&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 标记关键业务节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateInventory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout-flow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 PerformanceObserver 采集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // entry.name = 'checkout-flow'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // entry.duration = 耗时（ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    sendToRUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ metric: entry.name, value: entry.duration });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'measure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>User Timing 的优势在于它完全自定义——Core Web Vitals 是通用指标，但每个业务都有自己的关键路径。电商关注&quot;商品列表到加入购物车的时间&quot;，SaaS 关注&quot;打开 Dashboard 到数据可交互&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Performance Timeline 是一族 W3C 标准，暴露导航、资源、绘制、交互等各类性能条目</li>\n<li>Navigation Timing 提供页面加载的完整时间节点链</li>\n<li>Event Timing 是 INP 的底层数据源，拆解 Input Delay / Processing / Presentation 三阶段</li>\n<li>Long Animation Frames API 提供脚本级归因，精确到函数名和源码位置</li>\n<li>User Timing 支持自定义业务指标，填补 Core Web Vitals 覆盖不到的业务关键路径</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"core-web-vitals-metrics\">Core Web Vitals 三大核心指标</a>——理解这些 API 服务的上层指标定义</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/runtime/event-loop-rendering\">浏览器渲染原理 — 事件循环与渲染</a>——理解 Long Task 和帧渲染的底层机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"浏览器性能时间线 API","id":"浏览器性能时间线-api"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Navigation Timing 详解","id":"navigation-timing-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"Event Timing 与 INP 测量","id":"event-timing-与-inp-测量"},{"level":2,"text":"Long Animation Frames（LoAF）API","id":"long-animation-frames-loaf-api"},{"level":2,"text":"User Timing 自定义标记","id":"user-timing-自定义标记"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"性能度量模型与 Lab vs Field","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/foundations/performance-measurement-model"},"next":{"title":"PerformanceObserver API 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/performance-observer-api"}}